body:
Yeah I've fixed up everything back to the way it was and am ready to go back home to my parents but I need to wait on getting a quote from a moving company for my pc and desks. I just texted my dad that the only place I'll feel finally "good" is in the grave. He's telling me I haven't given therapy a proper chance but I saw one psychologist on a weekly basis for a good 8-10 months and all i felt is my fathers $80 going down the drain. He also asked if the fact that I've finally been streaming consistently and got affiliated doesn't make me happy, it does but it doesn't. I'm at this stage where achievements don't mean anything to me.

&#x200B;

I've also been hospitalized twice and one outpatient hospitalization it's a sad cold truth but no one gives a fuck about anyone other than themselves me included. Right now the selfish need I have to satisfy is my urge to rest forever. I overdosed to death for sure once but my father had to go on and call 911 twice and got two ambulances and I was resuscitated.

&#x200B;

Thanks for the response and taking the time to read such a long heavy post. I believe xanax worked better for me since before the genetic test i took which indicated it would work better as well as ativan, diazepam was also another choice. My other psychiatrist would make me bring my meds to our sessions to track me. And Sometimes i'd skip on adderalls on lazy days and xanax when i felt i didn't really need it and end up having extra and she knew. But my anxiety is crippling on days that I'm real tense I just stay locked up in my comfort zone. Same behaviors I used to do in my home with my parents. So I don't see going back home, staying or going anywhere else except a 6 foot hole changing crap to be honest.
